  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU funded JP Green and Circular Economy: Waste Reduction and Recycling for Citizen&#x2019;s Health aims to improve resource efficiency and reduce wastes for a circular and green economy, particularly primarily focusing on waste recycling reduction, by improving separate collection and recycling infrastructure, fostering behavioural change and building knowledge and implementation capacities of key stakeholders. Targeted waste streams include: batteries and accumulators, waste oils (WOs), end-of-life</narrative>
